		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: &quot;Tx Failed: Be Disabled&quot; after using 4.2.6 for foundation]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4422&amp;p=33101#p33101"><![CDATA[
Are you referring to the official firmware 4.2.6 ??<br><br>i.e Not the OpenGD77 firmware ??<br><br>There are known bugs in the official firmware which under some circumstances, can cause the official firmware to prevent any new firmware updates being loaded.<br><br><br>So if your radio will no longer enter firmware update mode, then it sounds like you have that problem.<br><br>If thats the case there is No software fix. The only fix is to reflash the CPU using a programming dongle like a JLink Edu Mini, and this requires the radio to be disassembled and wires attached to the main PCB.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Sep 21, 2024 5:19 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
